  59+ 9D3D 01 FD 7F         LD BC, $7FFD
  60+ 9D40 ED 79            OUT (C), A
  61+ 9D42 CD 4C E5         CALL AY_UpdateBellImpl
  62+ 9D45 3A 57 90         LD A, (CurrentPaging)
  63+ 9D48 E6 F8            AND $F8
  64+ 9D4A 32 57 90         LD (CurrentPaging), A
  65+ 9D4D 01 FD 7F         LD BC, $7FFD
  66+ 9D50 ED 79            OUT (C), A
