1436+ AAAD              ; CheckPlayerMonsterOverlap - Bloquear player contra monsters (colision solida)
1437+ AAAD              ; ==============================================================================
1438+ AAAD              ; IX = player entity. Comprueba AABB con todos los monsters activos.
1439+ AAAD              ; Usa GetSpriteDims para dimensiones reales (soporta monsters de cualquier tamaño).
1440+ AAAD              ; Retorna Z=libre, NZ=bloqueado por algun monster.
1441+ AAAD              ; ==============================================================================
1442+ AAAD              CheckPlayerMonsterOverlap:
1443+ AAAD                  ; Debug noclip: Z = libre siempre (sin bloqueo por monsters)
1444+ AAAD 3A EE 81         LD A, (NoclipMode)
1445+ AAB0 B7               OR A
1446+ AAB1 28 02            JR Z, .cpmoReal
1447+ AAB3 AF               XOR A
