1774+ AC91 DD 77 03         LD (IX+ENT_POSX), A
1775+ AC94 18 2A            JR .noPushBackPop
1776+ AC96
1777+ AC96                  ; Attack east: comprobar X+23 en fila superior E inferior → mover -8
1778+ AC96              .pushBackEast:
1779+ AC96 D5               PUSH DE
1780+ AC97 C5               PUSH BC
1781+ AC98 DD 7E 03         LD A, (IX+ENT_POSX)
