3956+ B8C6 DD 96 08         SUB (IX+ENT_ANIMBASE)           ; offset dentro de puff
3957+ B8C9 FE 06            CP ANIM_FRAMES_PUFF             ; >= 6 → animacion terminada
3958+ B8CB 38 09            JR C, .dyFrameOk
