3978+ B8E0                  ; Calcular posicion en buffer: count × 5
3979+ B8E0 6F               LD L, A
3980+ B8E1 26 00            LD H, 0
3981+ B8E3 29               ADD HL, HL
3982+ B8E4 29               ADD HL, HL
3983+ B8E5 29               ADD HL, HL                          ; count × 8 (simplificado)
3984+ B8E6                  ; Corregir: count × 5 = count × 4 + count
3985+ B8E6 6F               LD L, A
3986+ B8E7 26 00            LD H, 0
3987+ B8E9 54               LD D, H
3988+ B8EA 5D               LD E, L
3989+ B8EB 29               ADD HL, HL
3990+ B8EC 29               ADD HL, HL                          ; count × 4
3991+ B8ED 19               ADD HL, DE                          ; count × 5
3992+ B8EE 11 7C 5F         LD DE, PendingEraseSlots
3993+ B8F1 19               ADD HL, DE
