6552+ C7AB 0F               RRCA
6553+ C7AC 0F               RRCA
6554+ C7AD 0F               RRCA
6555+ C7AE E6 1F            AND $1F
6556+ C7B0 32 73 5F         LD (DBfsPlayerCy), A
