6786+ C93B ED 5B 6D 5F      LD DE, (DBfsQTail)
6787+ C93F              .bivLoop:
6788+ C93F                  ; HL == DE -> end
6789+ C93F E5               PUSH HL
6790+ C940 B7               OR A
6791+ C941 ED 52            SBC HL, DE
