1041+ CF52 29               ADD HL, HL
1042+ CF53 29               ADD HL, HL
1043+ CF54 29               ADD HL, HL
1044+ CF55 29               ADD HL, HL                          ; HL = charY * 32
1045+ CF56 7B               LD A, E
1046+ CF57 0F               RRCA
1047+ CF58 0F               RRCA
1048+ CF59 0F               RRCA
