 348+ E6B3                  ; --- Atributos del sprite (2 filas × 6 cols) ---
 349+ E6B3                  ; Layout: [dec0][dec1][sfera_L][sfera_R][dec2][dec3]
 350+ E6B3                  ; Decoracion (cols 0,1,4,5): remap paper via ApplyDayCycleRemap
 351+ E6B3                  ; Esfera (cols 2,3): sin remap (gestionada por DrawClockFaceOnly)
 352+ E6B3 DD 23            INC IX                  ; saltar attr_h
 353+ E6B5 DD 23            INC IX                  ; saltar attr_w
 354+ E6B7 AF               XOR A
