 153+ E9C6 CD FA E9         CALL ResolveObjectiveScreen
 154+ E9C9 3E FF            LD A, $FF
 155+ E9CB 32 FA 81         LD (PreviousObjectiveDistance), A   ; brujula: primer cruce -> blanco
 156+ E9CE C9               RET
 157+ E9CF              .cmdkNotPressed:
