1145+ EE02 CD AA 67         CALL DrawSmokeFrameXor
1146+ EE05 18 29            JR .ucsSmokeIncFrame
1147+ EE07              .ucsSmokeStep1:
1148+ EE07 AF               XOR A
1149+ EE08 CD AA 67         CALL DrawSmokeFrameXor                  ; erase smoke[0]
1150+ EE0B 3E 01            LD A, 1
1151+ EE0D CD AA 67         CALL DrawSmokeFrameXor                  ; draw smoke[1]
1152+ EE10 18 1E            JR .ucsSmokeIncFrame
1153+ EE12              .ucsSmokeStep2:
1154+ EE12 3E 01            LD A, 1
1155+ EE14 CD AA 67         CALL DrawSmokeFrameXor                  ; erase smoke[1]
1156+ EE17 3E 02            LD A, 2
1157+ EE19 CD AA 67         CALL DrawSmokeFrameXor                  ; draw smoke[2]
1158+ EE1C 18 12            JR .ucsSmokeIncFrame
1159+ EE1E              .ucsSmokeEnd:
1160+ EE1E 3E 02            LD A, 2
1161+ EE20 CD AA 67         CALL DrawSmokeFrameXor                  ; erase smoke[2]
1162+ EE23 CD C9 67         CALL ClearSmokeAttrs                    ; 2x2 chars -> paper/ink black
1163+ EE26 3E 04            LD A, 4
1164+ EE28 32 03 82         LD (ChurchCutscenePhase), A
1165+ EE2B AF               XOR A
1166+ EE2C 32 9D 5F         LD (ChurchCutsceneFrame), A
1167+ EE2F C9               RET
